      "content": "it's just not working. the \"fog lifting\" thing sounds nice but i've been in it for months and it's just getting thicker. i look at his things and it just feels like it would be so much more peaceful to just... not have to feel this. to just be with him instead of being here alone. wouldn't it be more natural if i could just go where he is?",
